#: ai/templates/ai/chat.html:414
msgid ""
"Tell me what kind of trip you're thinking about - dates, budget, climate, "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"Dites-moi à quel type de voyage vous pensez - dates, budget, climat, tout ce "
